{"id":"nara-city","name":"奈良","en":"Nara (city)","country":"Japan","lat":34.685,"lng":135.8048,"dek":"古都的尺度是步行，鹿与木构建筑比邻而居。","history":"710年，元明天皇将首都从藤原京迁至平城京，地址就在今天的奈良市区。这座都城东西约6.3公里，南北约4.7公里，在七十多年间一直是日本的政治中心，人口最多时约达十万。朝廷多次派遣遣唐使，从中国带回的文物与本土文化融合，形成后世所称的天平文化。","culture":"奈良的日常景观里，鹿与古迹同样醒目。春日大社的传说中，神灵曾骑白鹿而来，鹿因此被视为神的使者并受到保护。如今奈良公园一带栖息着约一千二百头野生鹿，它们会接近手持鹿仙贝的游人，也会翻找包装纸或追逐摊贩。","pull":"把鹿视为神的使者，一座城因此保留了森林与古寺。","sights":[{"name":"东大寺","orig":"东大寺","intro":"奈良公园内最著名的寺院，大佛殿内供奉着日本最大的铜制毗卢遮那佛坐像，也是世界最大的木造建筑之一。通往大佛殿的道路由来自印度、中国、朝鲜和日本的石材铺成，象征佛教东传的路径。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/97/Golden_Hall%2C_Todaiji.jpg/960px-Golden_Hall%2C_Todaiji.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":586},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%9C%E5%A4%A7%E5%AF%BA"},{"name":"春日大社","orig":"春日大社","intro":"建于奈良时代的神社，与东大寺、兴福寺同处奈良公园一带。信仰中鹿是神的使者，因此周边野生鹿受到长期保护。境内多石灯笼，沿山而上层层排列，气氛与闹市截然不同。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b7/Kasuga-taisha%2C_chumon-3.jpg/960px-Kasuga-taisha%2C_chumon-3.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":638},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%98%A5%E6%97%A5%E5%A4%A7%E7%A4%BE"},{"name":"兴福寺","orig":"兴福寺","intro":"南都七大寺之一，与东大寺相邻。寺院内的五重塔高耸于奈良天际线上，旁边猿泽池水面常映出塔影。国宝馆中保存着阿修罗像等众多奈良时代至平安时代的佛教造像。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/Kofukuji12st5s3200.jpg/960px-Kofukuji12st5s3200.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":640},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/K%C5%8Dfuku-ji"},{"name":"唐招提寺","orig":"唐招提寺","intro":"由唐代僧人鉴真主持兴建，保留着天平时期建筑式样。金堂与讲堂线条质朴，庭园静谧，与奈良东部的观光核心区保持一定距离，适合步行前往。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/69/Toshodaiji_Nara_Nara_pref04s5s4290.jpg/960px-Toshodaiji_Nara_Nara_pref04s5s4290.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":640},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%94%90%E6%8B%9B%E6%8F%90%E5%AF%BA"},{"name":"奈良国立博物馆","orig":"奈良国立博物馆","intro":"以佛教艺术收藏闻名，馆内展出大量奈良时代造像。每年秋季的正仓院展期间，来自东大寺正仓院的宝物会在此轮换展出，排队人流从馆前一直延伸到公园。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/140927_Nara_National_Museum_Nara_Japan01bs5.jpg/960px-140927_Nara_National_Museum_Nara_Japan01bs5.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":640},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A5%88%E8%89%AF%E5%9B%BD%E7%AB%8B%E5%8D%9A%E7%89%A9%E9%A6%86"}],"foods":[{"name":"柿叶寿司","orig":"柿の叶ずし","intro":"奈良一带的特色寿司，多为青花鱼或鲑鱼，用柿叶包裹后压制而成。叶子带出轻微香气，常见于车站便当或老铺店头，适合外带。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/Kakinohazusi.jpg/960px-Kakinohazusi.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9F%BF%E8%91%89%E5%A3%BD%E5%8F%B8"},{"name":"三轮素面","orig":"三轮そうめん","intro":"发源于奈良三轮地区的细面，历史久远。可冷食也可热食，口感细滑，常配以姜、葱和蘸汁。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/05/Somen_001.jpg/960px-Somen_001.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":593},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/S%C5%8Dmen"},{"name":"葛切","orig":"葛切り","intro":"用吉野葛制成的透明粗面条状甜点，浸在冷水中取食，口感滑韧，常佐以黑蜜。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/10/Kudzu-kiri_by_hirotomo_in_Nara.jpg/960px-Kudzu-kiri_by_hirotomo_in_Nara.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":null},{"name":"鹿仙贝","orig":"鹿せんべい","intro":"奈良公园周边专为鹿制作的米饼，游客可购买后投喂。仙贝给人食用并不合适，味道也远不如闻起来香甜。","img":null,"src":null}],"hero":[{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/Nara_City_Office_201411.jpg/1280px-Nara_City_Office_201411.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":720},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/26/Kinteetsu_Nara_sta_001.jpg/1280px-Kinteetsu_Nara_sta_001.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":857}],"outline":null,"credit":{"model":"deepseek-v4-pro","wiki":{"zh":"奈良市","en":"Nara (city)","voyage":"Nara"}}}